# Raw exchange data never enters this tree.
#
# Republishing CME settlement prices is REDISTRIBUTION under Databento's licence: it would
# turn a non-professional subscriber into a redistributor and require a CME information
# licence agreement plus fees. Kalshi's terms prohibit redistribution outright. Derived data
# is permitted provided it cannot be reverse-engineered back to the feed, so data/ holds only
# per-meeting summary tables (see data/README.md). Anything row-level stays out.
*.parquet
*.duckdb
*.jsonl
*.jsonl.gz
*.csv.gz
data/raw/
data/panel/

__pycache__/
.venv/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
